        "flatFlambdaAnalytic": 1.2215739133645986
      },
      "note": "The committed expectation was an error made when the contract was written: a break of 1 for a flat spectrum holds for a spectrum flat in F_nu; the flat world is flat in F_lambda, whose F_nu rises as lambda squared, so the definition gives the ratio of the band means of lambda squared, not 1. The correlation and the line method behaved as committed, and a spectrum flat in F_nu returns 1 (flatFnu). The leg is left failing as committed; only Carl resets a bound."
    },
