      "note": "The break is 1 to 1e-15 with no break flagged, and the line method is not constrained, as committed. The correlation is not refused no-structure: a spectrum flat in F_nu is a power law in F_lambda, which the 101-sample high-pass does not remove exactly, so a smooth residual correlates weakly with the template and the answer is returned with the low-significance flag (q under 10, never ok). The committed expectation presumed a constant spectrum. Left failing as committed; a later contract should expect \"not ok\" here."
